            "text": "<p>The mower comes with one spacer pre-fitted and can be set to 4 cutting heights between 12mm and 33mm. Choose the appropriate cutting height according to the condition of your grass.</p><p>Watch the video below to see how to change the cutting height of your LawnMaster hover mower:</p>",
